{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"945b6f8dfa45653d22b9327d1dc730561b628205ad5daf271c1c581611326055","digest":{"component_or_area":"doctor lock census","key_entities":["rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger._WORKER_LOCK_NAME","rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot.store_root()","rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot.peek_store_root()","rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger._gc_dir","rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger.worker_lock_probe_path()","rebar._store.stamped_lock.stamped_file_lock","rebar._store.lock_owner.stamped_file_is_stale","rebar._commands.doctor_locks.scan_locks","rebar._commands.doctor_locks._existence_report","rebar/schemas/doctor.schema.json","tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py","LEG_SNAPSHOT_GC_WORKER"],"problem_keywords":["doctor census","lock probe","snapshot-gc worker","worker lock","stamped lock","stale lock detection","read-only derivation"],"propositions":["Doctor's lock census lacks visibility into the snapshot-GC worker lock at <snapshot-store>/gc/worker.lock, making it impossible to diagnose detached snapshot-GC workers that died holding the lock.","The snapshot-GC worker lock uses the same v2 stamped-file-lock pattern and staleness adjudication table as the drain and compact-worker locks, so doctor's existing _existence_report reader applies unchanged.","Directory derivation for the snapshot-GC worker lock path must be read-only (cannot create directories) to preserve the census's diagnostic guarantee, requiring new non-creating seams at the store-root and gc-dir layers.","The census reports the snapshot-gc-worker leg free when the per-host snapshot store does not yet exist, matching the behavior of other legs with absent lock files and without materializing missing directories."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787667156329307001,"uuid":"449bc497-37f5-437b-8171-3992aade1ca6"}